      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TCE is a document formalizing internship agreements between UnB, students, and employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a document required for students to complete during their internship stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) refers to a document that outlines the terms and conditions of a student internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) refers to an agreement between the student, university, and employer outlining internship terms and conditions."</data>
